 "title": "3. Present simple o present continuous?",
 "items": [
  {
   "type": "info",
   "title": "Come si distinguono",
   "html": "<b>Present simple</b> — abitudini, cose sempre vere.<br>Spie: every day, usually, always, never, on Mondays, sometimes.<br>Forma: <i>I work / he works</i><br><br><b>Present continuous</b> — quello che sta succedendo adesso.<br>Spie: now, at the moment, today, Look!, Listen!<br>Forma: <i>am / is / are + verbo-ing</i>"
  },
